 "source": "4a5eed2d4387f6cc",
 "code": "def clone_graph(node: \"Node | None\") -> \"Node | None\":\n    if node is None:\n        return None\n    clones = {node: Node(node.val)}        # original -> copy, keyed by identity\n    stack = [node]\n    while stack:\n        cur = stack.pop()\n        for nb in cur.neighbors:\n            if nb not in clones:\n                clones[nb] = Node(nb.val)   # clone on discovery\n                stack.append(nb)\n            clones[cur].neighbors.append(clones[nb])\n    return clones[node]\n",
